<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-491] Fixed height to container when result type is text</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-491</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In current behaviour we have a fixed height for result container that contains either graph or table, but if type is text then the container expands to infinitely.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When type is text; then this is mostly logs, so we can have scroll around it and have fixed height for this container.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
